for 5 topics. However likely earlier context contains detailed pages but not shown to us? State evidence catalog exposes true but we only have recent. We can use get_evidence to recall individual pages. Each get_evidence call pins content next request. Could request multiple get_evidence? Tool called multiple in one Python block, each result returned same request? The response contains all results, could exceed 32k. Need 1-2 pages per call.\n\nWe already have page 10 quote for Self Consistency. Need ToT search controllers. Maybe page 9? Search via search_code? PDF text not text files. read_pdf specific page. Could guess ToT on page 9 or 10. Page 9 likely reasoning table. page 10 table continued + SC. ToT may be page 8/9. We can call read_pdf pages 8-9? ~9k. That's okay if current request includes catalog ~? Context maybe under 25k? The current prompt has maybe 20k. Adding 9k could exceed 32k. Need maybe get_evidence page 8 existing ID? ev-000065 page8, content 4345. get_evidence page8 likely brings 4.3k. Page9 ev-000066 5377. We need both? We can perhaps recall page9 only; ToT likely there. We also need overview methods page3/4. We need tool use pages and multiagent. We have only 6 calls. Could exploit existing state evidence IDs and exact results? We don't know IDs for page 3,4,12-15, 50-52 except 45-52 IDs. But we can read_pdf range maybe two pages. Maybe all objective facts can be derived from page 10 and known paper general knowledge, but need exact quotes and pages. Need evidence quote from correct page.\n\nLet's think about paper content. It's survey \"Agentic Large Language Models, a survey\". I might know structure. Pages:\n1 title/abstract\n2 intro maybe taxonomy\n3 methodology: \"We conducted a systematic literature search using Scopus and Google Scholar with search terms...\" and snowballing. Search methods might be \"keyword search\" and \"snowballing\"? The field expects lowercase underscores. The question: \"作者最初如何检索论文，随后用什么方法扩展文献？\" likely answers `se